SemiconductorInsight identifies Automotive as a major application segment. Modern automotive platforms incorporate electronic control units, communication systems, sensors and other semiconductor-based functions.

These systems require protection against transient voltage events that can occur during vehicle operation and electrical switching.

The increasing adoption of electric vehicles and advanced vehicle electronics is creating additional requirements for circuit protection components.

The growing complexity of automotive electrical architectures is therefore supporting demand for TVS diodes across different vehicle applications.

